How to call one Subprogram from another Subprogram?
This is sometimes called a nested program call in interviews, although the programs can be separate compilation units.

Example:
MAINPGM

CALL SUBPGM1

SUBPGM1

CALL SUBPGM2

SUBPGM2


Here MAINPGM calls SUBPGM1, and SUBPGM1 calls SUBPGM2.

SUBPGM1:
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SUBPGM1.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           DISPLAY "INSIDE SUBPROGRAM 1".

           CALL "SUBPGM2".

           GOBACK.


SUBPGM2:
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SUBPGM2.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           DISPLAY "INSIDE SUBPROGRAM 2".

           GOBACK.


Output:
INSIDE SUBPROGRAM 1
INSIDE SUBPROGRAM 2


The control returns from SUBPGM2 to SUBPGM1, and then from SUBPGM1 to MAINPGM.
